# Not an Obligation
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
If we call this love, it must be ours.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
It is.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Not an illness. Not your promise. Not gratitude for being looked after.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
I love your impossible questions and your terrible board-game victories.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Good. Those will survive a cure.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
She takes your hand before asking the question.
